      "text": "You may be tired of clicking the \"trigger\" button. So I added a beatClock that will do it for us.\n\nThe beatClock tells the knob to send its value to the oscillator and then triggers the envelope.\n\nTo Do:\n* Click the \"start\" button on the beatClock.\n* Click on the beatClock's \"tempo\" jack and drag up and down.\n* Click on the knob and drag up and down to change the oscillator frequency.\n* Use on the beatClock's menu to change the pulse period in beats to 8:3.\n\n",
